msgstr[3] "porcji serka wiejskiego z owocami"

#. ~ Description of "cottage cheese with fruit"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Unaged curdled milk and whey, made by draining cheese rather than pressing "
