#. ~ Description of "water (purifying)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid ""
"You've dissolved tablets of disinfecting chemicals in this water to purify "
"it.  Soon it'll be ready to drink."
msgstr ""
"Rozpuściłeś w tej wodzie tabletki ze środkami dezynfekującymi, by ją "
"oczyścić. Wkrótce będzie zdatna do picia."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "water (purifying)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid ""
"After using the tablets and carefully decanting out the resulting clean "
"water, it's ready to drink"
msgstr ""
"Tabletki zadziałały, a po ostrożnym zlaniu powstałej czystej wody jest ona "
"zdatna do picia"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "water (purifying)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid ""
"The chlorine released by the tablets is still working.  You still need to "
"wait a bit before you can drink it."
msgstr ""
"Chlor uwalniany przez tabletki wciąż działa. Musisz jeszcze trochę poczekać, "
"zanim będzie można ją wypić."

